      "body": "DECISION (Palimpsest-owned policy) — node-position preservation when a semantic graph patch is applied to Palimpsest's canvas. Recorded as a boundary delta only because clauses 2 and 5 constrain what a patch payload must carry.\n\n1. Canvas owns geometry. A patch is semantic (nodes, edges, attributes)"
